What if `idna_flags[0]` has the IGNORED flag set? Then the code point is skipped in both loops. This is consistent.

What if `idna_flags[0]` has the DEVIATION flag set? Then the behavior depends on the `transitional` flag. If transitional, `len2 += map.nmappings` (which is 0). If non-transitional, `len2++`. This is consistent between the two loops.

